>
> My suggestion: Common Printing Dialog API -> CPDAPI (with the D, to not have
> Common Printing API).
>
> Common Printing Dialog API is a good name, as the pluggable dialog concept
> is for having one and the same printing dialog for all apps, independent
> whether the user or the distro opts for the OpenUsability dialog or any
> other one.
